guide forever/horde/04-barrens
title The Southern Barrens
faction Horde
levels 22-24
zone The Barrens
next forever/horde/05-stonetalon
pitch The Gold Road south from the Crossroads: Camp Taurajo, Blackthorn Ridge and Bael Modan to the Great Lift, then north to the Mor'shan Rampart.
pro Class training at 22 and 24
pro Picks up the Camp Taurajo flight path
con Opens with a bat and a zeppelin ride
con Three flights into the Crossroads

# Built from the simulator's consensus Horde route
# and Era-baseline reference data; not yet play-tested on Forever.
#
# Flow: Tarren Mill -> bat to the Undercity -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (training
# at 22, class quests) -> fly to the Crossroads: Egg Hunt, Chol'aruk -> Ratchet
# (Ziz Fizziks breadcrumb) -> down the Gold Road to Camp Taurajo (flight path,
# bind) -> Bristleback camp (Tribes at War, Blood Shard) -> Field of Giants
# (silithid eggs, the burned-out note, Aean Swiftriver's scroll) -> Gann
# Stonespire -> Blackthorn Ridge (Kuz, Nak, Lok; Razormane weapons) -> the
# Dustwallow border (Wrongly Blamed) -> Bael Modan (Gann's three quests) ->
# Brave Moonhorn at the Great Lift -> hearth to Camp Taurajo -> fly to the
# Crossroads -> north to the Mor'shan Rampart (Kadrak, Warsong Gulch; both
# optional) -> fly to Orgrimmar (training at 24) -> back to the Crossroads and
# west toward Stonetalon (forever/horde/05-stonetalon).
#
# Optional: The Runed Scroll (3513): Aean Swiftriver is a rare elite, so
# grouping up is advised; Quell the Silverwing Usurpers (7789) needs a Warsong
# Gulch Mark of Honor. Chol'aruk the Ravener (97003), Wrongly Blamed, Justly
# Corrected (97250) and the Rogue's Mission: Possible But Not Probable (2478)
# are optional too: Chol'aruk, the Outraged Pillagers and Gallywix are elite.
#
# Deviations from the consensus: the consensus picks up Egg Hunt and
# Chol'aruk on a second Crossroads visit at 23.6 and runs to Ratchet from
# there; here they are taken on arrival at 22 (the flight lands at the
# Crossroads anyway) and Ratchet is a short stop on the way south. The
# consensus binds at the Crossroads and in Ratchet; this guide keeps only the
# Camp Taurajo bind (the hearth back from the Great Lift). Message to Freewind
# Post is turned in at Freewind Post in forever/horde/07-thousand-needles;
# Stepping Stones at Sun Rock and Ziz Fizziks on the Webwinder Path in
# forever/horde/05-stonetalon. Same quest set as the consensus; under the
# simulator (Orc) this guide takes 2.26 h, the skeleton 2.38 h.
#
# Class quests: Warrior Speak with Ruga / Trial at the Field of Giants / Speak
# with Thun'grim (1823-1825); Warlock succubus chain (1507-1513, The Binding
# in Orgrimmar at the end); Rogue The Shattered Salute / Deep Cover / Mission:
# Possible But Not Probable (2460, 2458, 2478, turned in in Orgrimmar at the
# end); Shaman Call of Water (1528, 1530, 1535; the next step, 1536, waits at
# the Spring Well beside Tarren Mill, where the 30-40 band starts). Training
# at 22 and 24 in Orgrimmar.
#
# Left out: A New Ore Sample (1153, level 29, Gravelsnout kobolds off the
# route), Horde Presence (3514, level 29 elite in Ashenvale), Report to Kadrak
# / The Warsong Reports (6541/6543: the three reports are spread over
# Ashenvale and the turn-in is back at Kadrak; measured +0.39 h at the end of
# 07-thousand-needles), The Spirits of Stonetalon (1061, Orgrimmar to
# Seereth's camp on the way west: +0.16 h), Ishamuhale and the Ashenvale Hunt
# (882/6382, need 3261), Shredding Machines (1068, needs Goblin Invaders), the
# Agamaggan blessings (no XP), Warrior Brutal Armor (1838, level 30) and the
# Razorfen Kraul quests.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Orgrimmar

step To the Undercity
  zone Hillsbrad Foothills
  tip From Tarren Mill take the bat to the Undercity, then walk up out of the city to the zeppelin tower just outside the Ruins of Lordaeron. Board the zeppelin to Orgrimmar (the other one goes to Grom'gol).
  fly "Undercity"

step Zeppelin to Durotar
  zone Tirisfal Glades
  goto 60.7,58.9 "Zeppelin tower"

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip The zeppelin lands at the tower outside Orgrimmar's main gate. The flight master Doras stands on the tower in the Valley of Strength.
  getfp "Orgrimmar" npc 3310
  train class
  accept 1823 only Warrior            -- Sorek, Valley of Honor
  accept 1528 only Shaman             -- Searn Firewarder, Valley of Wisdom

step Gan'rul Bloodeye
  only Warlock
  tip The Cleft of Shadow is the canyon under the Valley of Strength.
  accept 1507                         -- Gan'rul Bloodeye
  turnin 1507                         -- Cazul, a few steps away
  accept 1508
  turnin 1508                         -- Zankaja, Valley of Strength
  accept 1509

step Shenthul
  only Rogue
  tip Shenthul stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Target him and type /salute to finish The Shattered Salute.
  accept 2460
  complete 2460
  turnin 2460
  accept 2458                         -- Deep Cover: Taskmaster Fizzule waits in the northern Barrens, on your way at the end of this guide

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Crossroads

step The Crossroads
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly to the Crossroads. Coming from Silverpine you may not know that flight path yet: leave Orgrimmar by the main gate and follow the road south through Durotar and west over the river to the Crossroads.
  fly "Crossroads"
  getfp "Crossroads" npc 3615         -- Devrak
  accept 868                          -- Korran
  accept 97003 optional               -- Gur'ak
  turnin 1358                         -- Apothecary Helbrim: Sample for Helbrim, if you came through Silverpine
  turnin 1509 only Warlock            -- Gazrog
  accept 1510 only Warlock

step Chol'aruk the Ravener
  tip Chol'aruk prowls the plains just east of the Crossroads. Chol'aruk is elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 58.0,27.0 "Chol'aruk" optional
  collect 276070 quest 97003 optional

step Ratchet
  tip Follow the road south-east to Ratchet on the coast. Sputtervalve stands by the docks.
  accept 1483                         -- Keep it: Ziz Fizziks is on the Webwinder Path in Stonetalon
  getfp "Ratchet" npc 16227 optional  -- Bragok

step Islen Waterseer
  only Shaman
  tip Islen waits on the hill south of the Ratchet road.
  turnin 1528
  accept 1530

step Ken'zigla
  only Warlock
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Ken'zigla lives in Malaka'Jin, the troll village just inside Stonetalon at the end of the road west of the Crossroads. A long detour, but it is the way to your succubus.
  turnin 1510
  accept 1511

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Camp Taurajo

step Camp Taurajo
  zone The Barrens
  tip Down the Gold Road south to Camp Taurajo.
  getfp "Camp Taurajo" npc 10378      -- Omusa Thunderhorn
  sethome "Camp Taurajo" npc 7714     -- Innkeeper Byula
  accept 878                          -- Mangletooth, in the cage
  accept 893                          -- Tatternack Steelforge
  accept 97250 optional               -- Grunt Logmar
  turnin 1511 only Warlock            -- Grunt Logmar
  accept 1515 only Warlock
  turnin 1823 only Warrior            -- Ruga Ragetotem
  accept 1824 only Warrior

step Bristleback camp
  tip The Bristleback quilboar camp straddles the Gold Road just north of Camp Taurajo. Water Seekers, Thornweavers and Geomancers all drop Blood Shards: keep one for Mangletooth. Lakota'mani, a grey kodo, sometimes wanders here: his hoof starts a quest.
  goto 47.6,52.5 "Bristleback camp"
  kill 3260 quest 878.1
  kill 3261 quest 878.2
  kill 3263 quest 878.3
  collect 5075 x1
  collect 5099 x1 optional            -- Hoof of Lakota'mani
  accept 883 optional

step Grunt Dogran
  only Warlock
  tip Dogran is chained up in the quilboar camp west of the road.
  turnin 1515
  accept 1512                         -- Keep it: Gan'rul in Orgrimmar, at the end of this guide

step Camp Taurajo
  turnin 878                          -- Mangletooth
  accept 5052
  turnin 5052
  accept 879
  turnin 883 optional                 -- Jorn Skyseer
  collect 5102 x1 optional            -- Owatanka's Tailspike: the blue thunder lizard Owatanka roams east of Camp Taurajo
  accept 884 optional
  turnin 884 optional
  note Mangletooth trades more Blood Shards for blessings such as Spirit of the Wind (run speed): handy, not needed.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- South loop

step Field of Giants
  tip South of Camp Taurajo the Silithid Mounds dot the Field of Giants; the eggs lie in them, and Silithid Swarmers come out to defend them. Aean Swiftriver, a night elf, camps among them: his Runed Scroll starts a quest. Aean Swiftriver is elite: grouping up is advised. The Burned-Out Remains of a campfire lie by the road at the south end. Silithid Harvesters are rare: if you see one, kill it for its head.
  goto 44.7,70.7 "Field of Giants"
  collect 5058 quest 868
  collect 10621 x1 optional @46.0,70.0 -- Aean Swiftriver
  accept 3513 optional                -- Keep it: Kadrak at the Mor'shan Rampart, at the end of this guide
  accept 79192 @46.3,73.9             -- The Burned-Out Remains: keep it for Sun Rock Retreat
  collect 7119 quest 1824 only Warrior -- Twitching Antennae from the silithid
  collect 5138 x1 optional @42.0,70.0 -- Harvester's Head
  accept 897 optional

step Gann Stonespire
  tip Gann waits in a small camp further south, on the road toward Bael Modan.
  accept 843
  turnin 1530 only Shaman             -- Brine, just west of Gann
  accept 1535 only Shaman
  collect 7769 quest 1535 only Shaman @44.3,76.8 -- Fill the Empty Brown Waterskin at the quilboar watering hole
  turnin 1535 only Shaman
  accept 1536 only Shaman             -- Keep it: the Spring Well is beside Tarren Mill

step Blackthorn Ridge
  tip West of Gann, the Razormane hold Blackthorn Ridge. Kuz (level 21) is on the east side, Nak (23) to the south, Lok Orcbane (25) at the west end. Pathfinders and Stalkers drop the Backstabber, Seers the Wand, Warfrenzies the War Shield. Washte Pawne, a rare red wind serpent, flies over the ridge: its feather starts a quest.
  goto 42.5,81.0 "Blackthorn Ridge"
  collect 5074 quest 879.3            -- Kuz
  collect 5073 quest 879.2            -- Nak
  collect 5072 quest 879.1            -- Lok Orcbane
  collect 5093 quest 893.1
  collect 5092 quest 893.2
  collect 5094 quest 893.3
  collect 5103 x1 optional            -- Washte Pawne's Feather
  accept 885 optional

step Alliance on the border
  tip East of Gann, Alliance soldiers and pillagers from Theramore push over the Dustwallow Marsh border. The Outraged Pillagers are elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 49.0,77.0 "Dustwallow border" optional
  complete 97250 optional

step Bael Modan
  tip South of Gann, the Bael'dun dwarves dig at Bael Modan. Excavators and Foremen work the pit; Prospector Khazgorm carries the journal.
  goto 47.5,85.3 "Bael Modan dig site"
  kill 3374 quest 843.1
  kill 3375 quest 843.2
  collect 5006 quest 843.3

step Gann Stonespire
  turnin 843
  accept 846

step Bael'dun fortress
  tip The Bael'dun Soldiers, Riflemen and Officers guard the fortress on the east side of the dig; all three items drop from them.
  goto 49.0,84.2 "Bael'dun fortress"
  collect 5017 quest 846.1
  collect 5018 quest 846.2
  collect 5019 quest 846.3

step Gann Stonespire
  turnin 846
  accept 849

step The flying machine
  tip The dwarves' flying machine sits on its platform inside the dig site.
  interact 3644 quest 849

step Gann Stonespire
  turnin 849

step Brave Moonhorn
  tip Follow the road south to the Great Lift. Brave Moonhorn stands at its top.
  accept 4542                         -- Keep it: Cliffwatcher Longhorn at Freewind Post

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Back north

step Camp Taurajo
  hearth "Camp Taurajo"
  turnin 879                          -- Mangletooth
  accept 906
  turnin 97250 optional               -- Grunt Logmar
  turnin 893                          -- Tatternack Steelforge
  turnin 885 optional                 -- Jorn Skyseer
  turnin 897 optional
  turnin 1824 only Warrior            -- Ruga Ragetotem
  accept 1825 only Warrior
  vendor nearest

step The Crossroads
  fly "Crossroads"
  turnin 906                          -- Thork, at the top of the tower
  turnin 868                          -- Korran
  turnin 97003 optional               -- Gur'ak

step Thun'grim Firegaze
  only Warrior
  tip Thun'grim camps on the hill just east of the Crossroads.
  turnin 1825
  note He offers Brutal Armor next: level 30, with pieces all over Kalimdor and the Eastern Kingdoms. Leave it.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Mor'shan Rampart

step The Mor'shan Rampart
  tip Take the road north from the Crossroads to the Mor'shan Rampart at the Ashenvale border. Kadrak watches from the tower; Captain Shatterskull stands at the base camp below.
  turnin 3513 optional                -- Kadrak

step Warsong Gulch
  tip Captain Shatterskull wants a Warsong Gulch Mark of Honor. Queue for the battleground here if you want it; the follow-up pays out at once.
  accept 7789 optional
  complete 7789 optional
  turnin 7789 optional
  accept 7925 optional
  turnin 7925 optional

step Taskmaster Fizzule
  only Rogue
  tip Fizzule runs the Venture Co. camp east of the Mor'shan Rampart. He attacks strangers: target him and /salute before he does.
  turnin 2458
  accept 2478 optional

step Mission: Possible But Not Probable
  only Rogue
  tip Stay stealthed: Foreman Silixiz carries the key to the tower; Gallywix and his lockbox are at the top. Gallywix is elite: grouping up is advised.
  goto 54.8,5.6 "Venture Co. tower" optional
  collect 8072 quest 2478.1 optional
  kill 7310 quest 2478.2 optional
  kill 7308 quest 2478.3 optional
  kill 7307 quest 2478.4 optional
  collect 8073 quest 2478.5 optional
  collect 8074 quest 2478.6 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar at 24

step Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Walk back south to the Crossroads and fly to Orgrimmar to train your level 24 ranks.
  fly "Orgrimmar"
  train class

step The Binding
  only Warlock
  tip Gan'rul Bloodeye stands in the Cleft of Shadow. Use Dogran's Pendant on the summoning circle there and defeat the succubus to bind her.
  turnin 1512
  accept 1513
  use 6626 @49.4,50.0                 -- Dogran's Pendant
  kill 5677 quest 1513
  turnin 1513

step Shenthul
  only Rogue
  turnin 2478 optional                -- Shenthul, Cleft of Shadow
  note If you finished it, Shenthul then sends you to Serge Hinott in Hillsbrad (Hinott's Assistance); the 30-40 band starts in Tarren Mill.

step West to Stonetalon
  zone The Barrens
  tip Fly back to the Crossroads and take the road west to Stonetalon. It climbs past Malaka'Jin into the mountains; the Webwinder Path leads north to Sun Rock Retreat.
  fly "Crossroads"
  goto 35.3,27.9 "Stonetalon road"
